## Legacy system (utrzymywany dla kompatybilnosci wstecznej)

Ponizsze sekcje sa utrzymywane dla kompatybilnosci wstecznej.
Glownym zrodlem pamieci miedzy sesjami jest Reflection Protocol (§0).

At the **end of every session** (before stopping or handing off), the agent MUST:

### 1. Update knowledge/memory/LAST_SESSION.md

Write a structured summary covering:

- **Co zrobione** — table of changes (file, area, result)
- **State before** — what was broken
- **State after** — system state at session end
- **Backlog delta** — what P0/P1 items were closed, what opened
- **Operator decisions** — any new decisions that should go to OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md
- **Next** — recommended next steps

### 2. Update top-code-memory/LAST_SESSION.md

Copy or mirror the same summary here (the hooks archive this file automatically).

### 3. Run session-end hooks

The hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json` under **`sessionEnd`** (once per chat close):

- `session-stop-reflect.js` → `PENDING_REFLECTION.md` if architectural decisions detected
- `session-stop-arch-refresh.js` → git diff, write DRIFT.md, update .last-refreshed
- `session-stop-engram.js` → archive LAST_SESSION.md into `top-code-memory/sessions/`
- `session-stop-parse-transcript.js` → `top-code-memory/TRANSCRIPT_PARSE.md` (no chat injection)
- `session-stop-auto-review.js` → `AUTO_REVIEW_PENDING.md` when divergence found

Log: `top-code-memory/SESSION_CLOSEOUT.log`

**Manual closeout** (operator: „uruchom hooki końca sesji”):
`powershell -File scripts/run-session-stop-hooks.ps1`

Hooks do **not** use `stop` (per-turn). They never inject `followup_message` into chat.

### 4. Save new operator decisions

If the operator made any decisions this session, append them to:
`knowledge/memory/OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md` with `## [ACTIVE] YYYY-MM-DD — Title` format.

### 5. Update backlog

If any P0/P1 items were closed or opened, update:
`knowledge/memory/BACKLOG.md`

### Memory file locations

| File                                             | Purpose                                               |
| ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `top-code-memory/reflections/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` | **PRIMARY** — Reflection (decisions + justifications) |
| `top-code-memory/reflections/INDEX.md`           | Master index of all reflections                       |
| `top-code-memory/LAST_SESSION.md`                | Legacy session summary (mirror)                       |
| `top-code-memory/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`    | Archived session engrams                              |
| `top-code-memory/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl`      | Archived full transcripts                             |
| `top-code-memory/INDEX.md`                       | Master index of all sessions                          |
| `top-code-memory/DRIFT.md`                       | Git diff per session (auto, by hook)                  |
| `knowledge/memory/OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md`         | Canonical operator decisions                          |
| `knowledge/memory/BACKLOG.md`                    | Open tasks P0-P3                                      |
